// How a standing town is drawn, read by `crates/pbd-app/src/towns.rs`.
//
// `dressing_cascades`: how many of the sun's four cascades, finest first, a
// town's dressing things (stalls, racks, pots, boats, barrels, cacti) cast
// into (`crab-breeze-lessons` rank 5, after Crab Breeze's cast distances).
// 1 to 4; 4 casts everywhere a building does. On foot the cascades end at
// about 14, 43, 165 and 900 m, so 3 is out to about 165 m, where a barrel's
// shadow is under one texel of the last cascade. Past it the shadow goes
// out through the cascades' own blend at that edge, never in one frame.
(
    dressing_cascades: 3,
)
